  "customHelp": "DECK: 42 cards total — 1 Partner + 1 Case + 40 Characters/Events. Max 3 copies per card ID (same ID across all art variants). SETUP: Place Partner and Case face-down. Draw 5 cards. Mulligan once: return any number of cards to deck, shuffle, draw same number back. Reveal Partner and Case to start. AUTO PHASE (start of each turn): (1) Activate your Partner and all your Field characters. (2) Draw 1 card from deck. (3) Place 2 cards face-down from your deck to your FILE Area (first player's first turn: only 1 card). PLAY CARD (once per turn): Card Level must be <= count of cards in your FILE Area. Card color must match your Case's color. Characters go to Field (active); Events resolve then go to Remove Area. NEXT HINT: Take the top card of your FILE Area to hand, then play 1 card from hand (FILE Area shrinks by 1 for Level check). DEDUCTION (推理): Tap an active Partner or Character -> gain evidence equal to their LP (draw that many cards face-down from deck to Evidence). Characters cannot Deduce on the turn they arrive. CONTACT (アクション vs Character): Tap your active Character, target an opponent Character. Compare AP — your AP >= opponent's AP removes their character. CASE ACTION (アクション vs 事件): Tap your active Character, target opponent's Case (needs 1+ opponent evidence). If not guarded: remove 1 opponent evidence, you gain 1 evidence. ASSIST (アシスト): Tap your Partner -> Partner moves to your FILE Area. If your FILE Area (including Partner) now has 7+ cards -> your Case enters Resolution phase (flip the marker). WIN: Tap Partner (Case Solved) when your Case is in Resolution phase AND your evidence count >= Case Level. LOSE: If you must Refresh (deck runs out) but your Remove Area is empty.",
